          "settings": {
            "text": "<h3>Where We Ship</h3><p>We ship across Europe from our warehouse in Heidelberg, Germany. All orders are dispatched within 1–2 business days of confirmation.</p><h3>Delivery Options &amp; Rates</h3><ul><li><strong>Standard (3–5 business days)</strong> — €4.95, free on orders over €100</li><li><strong>Express (1–2 business days)</strong> — €9.95</li></ul><p>Delivery times are estimates and may vary during peak periods. You will receive a tracking link once your order has been dispatched.</p><h3>VAT &amp; Duties</h3><p>All prices shown on our website are inclusive of 19% German VAT (MwSt). As we ship from within the European Union, there are no additional import duties or customs charges for customers located in EU member states.</p><p>Customers in Switzerland, Norway, or the United Kingdom may be subject to local import duties and VAT upon delivery. These charges are the responsibility of the recipient and are not collected by Penya Collective at checkout.</p><h3>About Our Fulfilment</h3><p>Our pieces are sourced directly from artisan partners in Zimbabwe and held at our warehouse in Heidelberg, Germany. This model allows us to maintain tight quality control, reduce transit times for European customers, and keep prices competitive.</p><p><strong>Warehouse address:</strong><br>Penya Collective<br>Steinhofweg 47<br>69118 Heidelberg, Germany<br>Tel: <a href=\"tel:+4915147416152\">+49 1514 7416152</a></p><h3>Returns &amp; Exchanges</h3><p>We accept returns within 14 days of delivery for unworn items in original condition with tags attached. To start a return, email <a href=\"mailto:info@penya.africa\">info@penya.africa</a> with your order number and reason for return. Return shipping costs are the responsibility of the customer unless the item is faulty or incorrectly sent.</p><p>Custom or final-sale items are non-returnable.</p>",
